      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d68421b80c9d7c2c90184fa22c6951224c036361c378c11d607129bae75ea54e--criminal-courts-2022-23-cube-15-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2022\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 14 of 14\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6237989254a36f8d28a833284a83500f1e1664a75300ff04570b8ed8a4ded24e | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 1\" | ec8dab18a6e9d3a639ade5f38b2bae05975d675eca07ca0f5eb9fdb0a0c9cdaa | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 2\" | 0b71050fd5ec6b82822e65dca5cdf35b04230a9e99ac5ab3494424a88f667139 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 3\" | 81f956ad1e9d3ab2ea38b075f594083f3b235495aa3a090c9bb0e913c707a5a1 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 4\" | 1e32f2877dcea7460517222c4f0baf49e40124a4c45b88aa63caa26802a725ad | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 5\" | ab1af8f7c08e97e4baa563b7b28b191ff906c42d399e875370bfe1eeb75d3722 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 6\" | 6fb4193e0bb17bad82009178c88f84f841965f32b1b1161471865682a564b33a | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 7\" | b499b8d6c0e3a5a264c478178c2072e302d7d782fbfb5642f6ada5716e7a7859 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 8\" | a3aeb60f7216f87a9ebcabc3d3787ccd60e9468a1783589b707454dd1eb37144 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 9\" | ec693d107d16bade237e78e9cdf75184261f8e0ae3969a3e9a4721c5d3e16bc5 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 10\" | 9bc9990f302320e53f7a2be3288621aa5e815c0345f33af797d367ada593eacf | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 11\" | dbc995865cd90a10075d09b264f370eaa5105c405f9c5d75963a9565f790d8a8 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 12\" | 7fcb91ef777abe40f8253ecc63391da58ed4a5e4f446618498e5836a8cf2bbe1 | missing |\n| \"FDV Table 13\" | 664c0543a77f2af216c834b41f586b5788096eaa65d56a5acdb5f620c366d7c3 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
